    "body": "## Problem\r\nWhen an LS client detaches from the buffer, only pull diagnostics are cleared via capability framework. Push diagnostics remain stuck even when client stops/restarts.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\nClear push diagnostics on client detach.\r\n\r\nCloses #33864 (probably)",
    "closed_at": "2026-07-08T16:00:21Z",
