            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "I think this is the wrong place for this.\n\nIn `lsp/diagnostics.lua`, you want to add the following to `on_detach()` right under `self:clear()`:\n\n```lua\nlocal push_ns = client_push_namespaces[client_id]\nif push_ns then\n  vim.diagnostic.reset(push_ns, self.bufnr)\nend\n```",
